SUMMARY:Dinner with 🥘 Meet'n'Dine
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/meet-n-dine/\n<strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://goo.gl/maps/1JsoL81FCVowCDFi6" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bächlerstrasse 44</a>\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Juraj Mičko (<a class="link" href="mailto:juraj.micko@cssz.ch" target="_blank" rel="noopener">juraj.micko@cssz.ch</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41762639679">+41762639679</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/meetndine-registration-205679010457" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Eventbrite</a>\n\n<p>CSSZ and <a class="link" href="https://www.notion.so/jjurm/Meet-n-Dine-c0d588aaa93046fe9724599c9ee62976" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Meet&rsquo;n&rsquo;Dine</a> invite you to a casual dinner with fellow students in the cosy environment of a student flat. Come join us and feel free to bring a friend!</p> <p>We&rsquo;ll be cooking <a class="link" href="https://blogchef.net/chinese-chicken-and-broccoli-recipe/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chinese Chicken and Broccoli Recipe</a>.</p> <picture class="img" style="background: url(data:image/jpeg;base64,&#43;gEAAwEBAQEBAQEBAQAAAAAAAAECAwQFBgcICQoLEQACAQIEBAMEBwUEBAABAncAAQIDEQQFITEGEkFRB2FxEyIygQgUQpGhscEJIzNS8BVictEKFiQ04SXxFxgZGiYnKCkqNTY3ODk6Q0RFRkdISUpTVFVWV1hZWmNkZWZnaGlqc3R1dnd4eXqCg4SFhoeIiYqSk5SVlpeYmZqio6Slpqeoqaqys7S1tre4ubrCw8TFxsfIycrS09TV1tfY2dri4&#43;Tl5ufo6ery8/T19vf4&#43;fr/2gAMAwEAAhEDEQA/AOA0aV7Qi8vbLzxeYSMYOIuRycHuuf071113pqxtZwrHNPAJQ8cCpulEZOdgOMnkhjnpkDnNedW3iW5/shNPaJAq/NHInyuhU569&#43;TXqmpeNTpvw90/Um0yK7vJXMDSzytyB8wJ24yQTXJWp1JTXK&#43;5pCpBOzRy2q&#43;B3u7hLyDU9I06C5QyRwz3BcldzKGB5wDtzjtyO1Uf&#43;EBuP&#43;hl0D/v43&#43;Fbt3rulwxWc&#43;q&#43;G7LUry8t0unlJ8pU3ZwiIBhVAA&#43;pye9Vv&#43;En8Nf9CNp3/f4/4V3QpvlV5GDk7n//2Q==); background-size: cover; display: inline;">             <source srcset='/images/events/2022-06-02-dinner-with-meetndine/chinese_chicken_and_brocolli_1_hu_fb47de90a382356a.webp 500w, /images/events/2022-06-02-dinner-with-meetndine/chinese_chicken_and_brocolli_1_hu_fb47de90a382356a.webp 500w'                     sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px"                     type="image/webp"             /><source srcset='/images/events/2022-06-02-dinner-with-meetndine/chinese_chicken_and_brocolli_1_hu_72357e93b1b93b15.jpeg 500w, /images/events/2022-06-02-dinner-with-meetndine/chinese_chicken_and_brocolli_1_hu_72357e93b1b93b15.jpeg 500w'                     sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px"                     type="image/jpeg"             /><img src="/images/events/2022-06-02-dinner-with-meetndine/chinese_chicken_and_brocolli_1_hu_72357e93b1b93b15.jpeg"                  width="500"                  height="333"                                                                                     /></picture> <hr> <h1 id="what-is-meetndine">What is Meet&rsquo;n&rsquo;Dine?</h1> <p><a class="link" href="https://www.notion.so/jjurm/Meet-n-Dine-c0d588aaa93046fe9724599c9ee62976" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Meet&rsquo;n&rsquo;Dine</a> brings people together to:</p> <ul> <li>socialise</li> <li>feed ourselves</li> <li>relax from school and real life</li> <li>learn new recipes</li> <li>get inspired about how others live their lives</li> <li>(optionally) discuss hard questions in life</li> </ul> <h1 id="who">Who</h1> <p>The group consists of mostly ETH (or UZH) students, but don&rsquo;t hesitate to reach out if you don&rsquo;t feel like a student and would still like to join.</p>
